a\nRequest Info\nApply\nVisit\nGive\nClose Search Menu\nLet Us Help\nSearch\nSearch\nGraduate Admission\nHome\nAdmission & Aid\nGraduate Admission\nA rich history of discovery for the good of society.\nIn This Section\nApplication Process\nFrequently Asked Questions\nVisiting & Events\nMeet the Staff\nOnline Programs\nRequest Information\nCommitted to Your Academic & Professional Pursuits\nGraduate studies at Catholic University prepare you to begin making your unique contributions to your chosen profession or field of academic study. We guide and challenge. You learn, master, and advance.\nU.S. Students\nTake the next step in your application process.\nGet Started\nInternational Students\nWe\u2019ll help you navigate the visa requirements and financial documentation necessary for your application.\nGet Started\nAsking Deeper Questions\nFounded in 1887 as a research university, Catholic University exists not just to preserve and pass on knowledge but to advance it through scholarship and modern research methods. And we continue to do exactly that today, probing into the deeper questions with scholarship and research that bears fruit in a unique and beautiful way.\nExplore Our Research\nAcademics & Schools\nExplore the more than 150 graduate and doctoral degrees that provide you multiple opportunities for research, discovery, and academic pursuit.\nResearch Facilities\nBrowse the list of our many on-campus research facilities, centers, and institutes that span the academic disciplines and offer a variety of opportunities to enhance your studies.\nScholarships & Grants\nGet funding for your advanced degree through various scholarships and grants.\nLearn More\nApply Today\nApply Now\nRequest More Information\nRequest Info\nApply\nVisit\nGive\nAthletics\nCardinal Shop\nLibraries\nDirectory\nCareers\nFor Media\nCopyright & Trademark\nPrivacy\nPolicies\nConsumer Information\nEn Espa\u00f1ol\nDisability Support\nReport Misconduct\nCompliance\nSite footer logo\nFacebook\nIn